OL,3,GNEWSACity co-housing plans face
OL,4,Aopposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA co-housing project for people who
OL,7,Fwant to "look out for each other, not
OL,8,Flook after each other" is being set up
OL,9,Fin what is thought to be the first
OL,10,Fscheme of its kind in south-west
OL,11,FEngland.
OL,13,FThe project has earmarked the
OL,14,FHoneylands House site, in Exeter, for
OL,15,F35 new homes for people aged 55 or
OL,16,Folder.
OL,18,FThey would each have their own
OL,19,Fproperties and some shared spaces for
OL,20,Fthings like laundry facilities,
OL,21,Fsocialising and optional cooking and
OL,22,Feating.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
