OL,3,GNEWSACity co-housing plans face
OL,4,Aopposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevelopers Aspen have put in a planning
OL,7,Fapplication for the site but there are
OL,8,Fdozens of objections from nearby
OL,9,Fresidents and the head of neighbouring
OL,10,FVranch House, a specialist centre which
OL,11,Fsupports children with physical
OL,12,Fdisabilities and complex needs.
